    "image_with_text_3cAhxa": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "position": "center",
        "heading": "<p>The morning I got in the car and drove west to the Atlantic</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/hf_20260829_124543_9cf8b77c-1535-4ea7-b807-fe8f2c8aefe9.jpg",
        "height": "adapt",
        "text": "<p>I don't know exactly when I decided. Or whether I decided at all. I just got in the car one morning and drove. West, toward the Atlantic. Without thinking. As if my body knew what it needed before I did.</p><p>Family had been around for three weeks. Everyone wanted to help. But nobody understood that I needed to be alone for a moment.</p><p>My mother was gone.</p><p>I had spent three weeks doing everything right. Calling who I needed to call. Saying what I was supposed to say. Smiling when it was time to smile. I was good at that.</p><p>What I wasn't so good at was staying still.</p><p>This is not a gentle coast. Anyone who has stood on the Atlantic side of this country knows that. It is raw, cold, and it doesn't care about you. The waves break against the dark rocks whether you are there or not. It doesn't stop for you.</p><p>That is why I went there.</p><p>I needed something that wouldn't stop for me.</p><p>I walked along the shore for hours. It was the first time in weeks I was completely alone. A strong wind was blowing off the Atlantic. The shingle was dark and wet under my boots. The cliffs rose around me on both sides.</p>",
        "column_text": "",
        "author_position": "",
        "layout": "image_last",
        "border_top": false,
        "button_label": "My story",
        "button_link": "shopify://blogs/news/the-morning-i-got-in-the-car-and-drove-to-the-coast",
        "new_tab": false,
        "show_button": true
      }
    },
    "collapsible_content_h8Azbn": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_hETxda": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I give it as a gift?",
            "heading_tag": "h5",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Many people give it as a gift — to a mother, a daughter, or a friend who carries something they don't know how to say. Write to me if you want help choosing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_9WCJ3V": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will I receive my jewelry?",
            "heading_tag": "h5",
            "answer": "<p>Delivery will be made by Registered Post service and should reach you within 4-7 working days (depending on sizing / special instructions etc)<br/><br/>If I am unable to despatch your order within our normal delivery period I will contact you to discuss and advise best options.<br/><br/>I offer free shipping within Republic of Ireland</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_n6FrJB": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does it mean that no two pieces of jewelry are alike?",
            "heading_tag": "h5",
            "answer": "<p>The stones in my jewelry each have their own unique character — no two are alike. The piece you receive will look like the image — but will never be identical. That is part of what you are ordering. The piece you receive is owned by no one else.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_H8nk6Y": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is shipping free?",
            "heading_tag": "h5",
            "answer": "<p>I offer free shipping within the Republic of Ireland.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_RNm6Lr": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What size should I choose?",
            "heading_tag": "h5",
            "answer": "<p>Use the size guide on the product page. If you have any doubts — write to me. I will gladly help you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_JG9f7M": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return the jewellery?",
            "heading_tag": "h5",
            "answer": "<p>You have 14 days to return your jewellery. Simply contact me by email, and we will help you arrange the return.</p><p><strong>Guarantee:</strong> All pieces come with a 2-year quality guarantee covering manufacturing defects.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_3NwRCY": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How to pay",
            "heading_tag": "h5",
            "answer": "<p>You can pay with Visa, Mastercard, Amex, Shop Pay, Google Pay, and Apple Pay.<br/>All payments are secure and encrypted by Stripe. You will not be charged until your order is confirmed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_MenMFp": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I write to you?",
            "heading_tag": "h5",
            "answer": "<p>You can write to me directly <a href=\"/pages/contact-me\" title=\"CONTACT ME\">here</a><br/>I reply myself. No assistant. No automatic messages.</p><p>I sit at the kitchen table in the evenings and read my messages. You will hear from me in less than 48 hours.</p><p>If you have questions about a design, a size — or simply want to tell me your story — write to me. I read everything.</p><p>— Aoife</p>"
          }
        }
      },
