            "tab_text": "<p><em><strong>Please follow this size guide to find your correct size</strong></em></p><h2>How to know your ring size</h2><p>All you will need is this ring size chart (the measurement is calculated using the inner diameter of the ring).</p><h3>With a ring you already have that fits you well</h3><ol><li>Select a ring you already own that fits well.</li><li>Measure the inner diameter of the ring in mm or inches.</li><li>Reference the table below to determine your size.</li></ol><h3>With a string</h3><p>Another simple way to measure your size is with a string. Wrap it around your finger at the point where you want to wear the ring.</p><p>*Be careful not to pull the string too tight or too loose — otherwise, the measurement will not be accurate.</p>",
